'''Monaco 2017''' was the first permanent [[Arenas|arena]] introduced to the game and was available for the first time in the [[Closed Alpha]]. It is based on the real-life town of [[wikipedia:Monaco-Ville|Monaco-Ville]] in the [[wikipedia:French Riviera|French Riviera]]. The arena is set on the [[wikipedia:Rock_of_Monaco|Rock of Monaco]] and features historic landmarks, dense urban streets, and lush gardens and parks
==Overview==
{{Infographic
|infographic-class=right
|display=image
|Image=MonacoOverview Hi-Res.jpg
|Text= Map of Monaco Arena by Embark Studios
}}
